## App-name: accounting
> School related accounting module

* Knowledge required
    - Accounting fiscal year
    - Income, Expense, Journal, Contra entries
    - Reports
        - Individual ledger report
        - Groupwise ledger report
        - Profit/Loss report
        - Trial balance
        - Cash flow statement

* Models:
    - BaseModels.py - `Base Model for all types of Entries`
        - Every entry must has `voucher_id`, see it's voucher_id property for format.
    - AccountingEconomicYear.py
        - Fiscal year per school for accounting purpose only
    - AccountingLedger.py
        - AccountingLedger - 
            - see `constants/ledger_groups.py` for AccountingLedger.ledger_ledger_group
        - AccountingBalance 
            - Closing balance per school, fiscal-year and ledger
* Entries
    - IncomeEntry
    - ExpenseEntry
    - JournalEntry - ``
    - ContraEntry - `Not implemented yet`

    * Particulars
        - Every entry has their particulars.

* Urls - `/accounting/...`
    - /economic_year
    - /economic_year/closing
    - /economic_year/closing/undo [Superadmin]
    - /ledgers
    - /income_entry
    - /expense_entry
    - /journal_entry
    - /contra_entry
    - /search/ledgers
    - /search/entries
    - /reports/ledger_report (Individual and Groupwise ledger report)
    - /reports/trial_balance
    - /reports/profit_loss
    - /reports/balance_sheet

